 "summary": "A female XLR receptacle with four poles in a round polyamide body. It mounts from behind a front panel, and its contacts solder into a horizontally mounted board. A dedicated ground contact connects the shell of the mating plug and the front panel. The female contacts are fork shaped, bronze, with hard gold over polished mating areas, and a nickel-plated steel latch holds the plug; receptacles fit on 23 mm centres and colour coding is offered.",
